### IDoc Parser Service - API tests (VS Code "REST Client" extension)
### Click "Send Request" above each ### line. App must run on :8000.

@base = http://localhost:8000/api/parser-service

### 1. Health
GET {{base}}/health

### 2. Config schema
GET {{base}}/config-schema

### 3. Echo execute (sanity check)
POST {{base}}/execute
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input": "ping"
}

### 4. Parse basic ORDERS05 (flat: E2EDK01005, E2EDK02, E2EDK03)
POST {{base}}/parse
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----idoc

------idoc
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="ORDERS05-basic.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

< ./ORDERS05-basic.txt
------idoc--
